><highlight color="#9643FC" opacity="0.399994" creationdate="D:20250702091919+10'00'" flags="print" IT="HighlightNote" date="D:20250702091928+10'00'" name="b59c2b02-7cac-46ab-bea1-d1c69c145b91" page="9" coords="306.141693,186.720154,544.034424,186.720154,306.141693,171.630280,544.034424,171.630280,306.141693,174.220154,544.266968,174.220154,306.141693,159.130280,544.266968,159.130280,306.141693,161.720154,544.048462,161.720154,306.141693,146.630280,544.048462,146.630280,306.141693,149.220154,544.412842,149.220154,306.141693,134.130280,544.412842,134.130280,306.141693,136.720154,544.353394,136.720154,306.141693,121.630280,544.353394,121.630280,306.141693,124.220154,544.255737,124.220154,306.141693,109.130280,544.255737,109.130280,306.141693,111.720154,544.275513,111.720154,306.141693,96.630280,544.275513,96.630280,306.141693,99.220154,544.280884,99.220154,306.141693,84.130280,544.280884,84.130280,306.141693,86.720154,544.250610,86.720154,306.141693,71.630280,544.250610,71.630280" rect="305.670135,71.158722,544.884399,187.191711" subject="Comment on Text" title="Alexander Gibson"
><contents-richtext
><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:25.1.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"
><p dir="ltr"
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-14.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>Q14c: </span
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-13.3pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>Elite athletes appear to experience higher rates of psychological&#xD;distress and mental health caseness than general&#xD;community peers, but concomitantly greater life satisfaction&#xD;and less susceptibility to problematic alcohol consumption&#xD;and gambling. A priority for clinical research is&#xD;to focus on developing interventions that can restore and&#xD;maintain athlete mental health, and ideally prevent the onset&#xD;of mental health symptoms, while being responsive to both&#xD;athlete and sports-specific contexts (e.g. high-performance</span
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-11.3pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
> </span
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-13.3pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>environments, high-arousal states and high determination&#xD;or perfectionism).</span
></p
></body
></contents-richtext
><popup flags="print,nozoom,norotate" open="no" page="9" rect="595.276001,94.720154,779.276001,186.720154"
/></highlight
